      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is much better. one last thing though—sometimes these things feel a little robotic or \"company-like.\" do you have any advice on how to keep the tone warm and human so it doesn't feel like just another automated rejection? like, how do i avoid sounding like a faceless corporation?",
